More efficient data storage for ReadCaloCrosstalkMap.

Change ReadCaloCrosstalkMap to store data in flat vectors rather then
in hash maps., using the indexing service.  This is faster and takes
much less space.  Also use CaloCellConstantsSvc to avoid duplicating
the data, and add a unit test.
